  "description": "The shared content engine for Webority products: one authoring contract that writes, re-authors or polishes a piece from a brief, evidence, a voice and dials under a per-family strategy read from data; a fixed head and tail that screen the inputs, verify every checkable claim against the evidence, repair what fails, validate every format limit in its unit and score the result; deterministic detectors, a craft rulebook, a format catalogue and a per-brand phrase ledger.",
